# Tech Stack
- Frontend: Next.js (React) with Tailwind CSS for rapid, responsive styling.
- Backend: PHP API endpoints communicating with XAMPP MySQL.

# Architecture & Rules
- Keep frontend components modular and mobile-first (students use phones!).
- All PHP backend endpoints must return clean JSON responses (`header('Content-Type: application/json')`).
- Use secure password hashing (`password_hash` in PHP).
- Organize the project clearly: `/frontend` for Next.js and `/backend` for PHP scripts.